        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave × Junction is an RPG where you battle monsters in a back-and-forth contest of blackjack, the playing card game familiar to many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters and delve dungeons. A fun tale of adventure all while being simple to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>–Game Features–</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Blackjack Style Turn-Based Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/8e8a4a7a2a1810e4563d5dd416d79995.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are a one-on-one turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who has the closest number to 21 in their hand? They deal an attack to the opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three distinctive playable characters make an appearance: The Fighter, with a head on battle-like creed; the Thief, unrivaled in sensing danger and thwarting it; and the Magician, who employs trickery at will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your strategy to chance? Entrap the enemy with trickery? The way you enjoy is up to you, the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Diverse Array of Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/4e0633ab5d69d0fc915197660350af51.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, orcs, dragons, and monsters, familiar to fantasy RPGs all lurk out of the depths, one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card hand concealing ghosts, trolls that surpass the 21-card value limit, and many more with a diverse array of skills stand in the way of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters from Rideon Japan's “Adventure Bar Story” and “Mercenaries Saga” series games even make an appearance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Loads of Factors to Augment, Unfolding a Blackjack Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/6b3de9ec8e1071211768d07d1da2a683.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boost cards as you advance the adventure, strengthening status and learning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities come along with some weapons and accessories, and at the Armory &amp; Forge in town, synthesis can allow for unbound customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining skills with abilities? This could bring to life new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you traverse the untrodden dungeons? It's all up to you, the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the title of this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players outside the Japanese region, please Advanced Search for &quot;Brave X Junction&quot; or &quot;Brave x Junction&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playing card designs feature characters from our games &quot;Mercenaries Wings&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Blaze&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Rebirth&quot;, and &quot;Mercenaries Lament&quot;.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave × Junction is an RPG where you battle monsters in a back-and-forth contest of blackjack, the playing card game familiar to many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters and delve dungeons. A fun tale of adventure all while being simple to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>–Game Features–</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Blackjack Style Turn-Based Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/8e8a4a7a2a1810e4563d5dd416d79995.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are a one-on-one turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who has the closest number to 21 in their hand? They deal an attack to the opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three distinctive playable characters make an appearance: The Fighter, with a head on battle-like creed; the Thief, unrivaled in sensing danger and thwarting it; and the Magician, who employs trickery at will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your strategy to chance? Entrap the enemy with trickery? The way you enjoy is up to you, the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Diverse Array of Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/4e0633ab5d69d0fc915197660350af51.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, orcs, dragons, and monsters, familiar to fantasy RPGs all lurk out of the depths, one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card hand concealing ghosts, trolls that surpass the 21-card value limit, and many more with a diverse array of skills stand in the way of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters from Rideon Japan's “Adventure Bar Story” and “Mercenaries Saga” series games even make an appearance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Loads of Factors to Augment, Unfolding a Blackjack Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/6b3de9ec8e1071211768d07d1da2a683.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boost cards as you advance the adventure, strengthening status and learning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities come along with some weapons and accessories, and at the Armory &amp; Forge in town, synthesis can allow for unbound customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining skills with abilities? This could bring to life new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you traverse the untrodden dungeons? It's all up to you, the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >・Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the title of this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players outside the Japanese region, please Advanced Search for &quot;Brave X Junction&quot; or &quot;Brave x Junction&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playing card designs feature characters from our games &quot;Mercenaries Wings&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Blaze&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Rebirth&quot;, and &quot;Mercenaries Lament&quot;.</p>",
